  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">support to cancer affected people</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">10 lakh new cases of cancer occur and 7 lakh die of various forms of cancer every year in India. In Tamilnadu, burden of cancer is predicted to increase by 32 per cent in 2016, translating to 55,000 new cancer cases per year as per a study by cancer institute. 80% of the cancer patients go to a doctor at an advanced stage and this hampers the treatment. VETNGO plans to do awareness&amp;screening camps and referral linkages so as to facilitate early detection, timely treatment in kallakuric district.</narrative>
  </description>
